  <body class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 min-h-screen font-sans selection:bg-sky-500 selection:text-white">
    <!--
      PRE-PUBLICATION CHECKLIST:
      1. Replace all [PLACEHOLDER] business identity and governing-law fields.
      2. Make Checkout consent flow match the digital-content withdrawal language in Section 14.
      3. Update the licensing backend so paid license time starts on first successful activation,
