            payment will be charged merely because a trial ends.
          </p>
          <p>
            We may limit or refuse trial access where reasonably necessary to prevent repeated claims,
            fraud, abuse, or circumvention of trial eligibility controls. Trial licenses may have different
            device-transfer or HWID-reset limits from paid plans.
          </p>
