            processors. Your order is considered paid only after the payment provider reports the payment
            status required for license issuance. Prices, accepted currencies, payment networks, applicable
            taxes, and any transaction or network fees will be presented or explained during checkout to
            the extent required by law.
          </p>
          <p>
            When paying with cryptocurrency, you are responsible for checking the payment address, network,
            currency, and amount displayed at checkout. Transfers sent to an incorrect address or unsupported
            network may be unrecoverable. This does not exclude any remedy required by applicable law or any
            refund obligation arising from our own error.
          </p>
          <p>
            You must not use a payment method without authorization. We may delay license issuance while a
            payment is pending, under review, reversed, or reasonably suspected to be fraudulent.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
