          <p>
            <strong class="text-white">TradeGuard is not a financial adviser, broker, investment adviser,
            fund manager, trading venue, or trade-signal provider.</strong> It does not provide investment,
            legal, tax, or financial advice and does not recommend that you enter into any particular trade.
