          <p>
            Trading financial derivatives, foreign exchange, binary options, cryptocurrencies, and other
            financial products involves substantial risk, including the possible loss of all capital used.
            Such products may not be suitable or lawful for every person or in every jurisdiction. You are
            solely responsible for your trading decisions, orders, account settings, and the risk parameters
