        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white"><span class="text-sky-400">14.</span> Refunds, Withdrawal, and Consumer Rights</h2>
          <p>
            Our <a href="/refund" class="text-sky-400 underline hover:text-sky-300">Refund Policy</a>
