          </p>
          <p>
            Nothing in these Terms or the Refund Policy excludes, restricts, or waives a statutory right to
            cancel, withdraw, obtain a repair, replacement, price reduction, refund, or other remedy where
            that right applies and cannot lawfully be excluded. A general statement that a digital purchase
