            ESTABLISHMENT COUNTRY / REGION]</strong>, without regard to conflict-of-law rules, except that
            this choice does not deprive a consumer of mandatory protections or the right to bring a claim
            before a court that has jurisdiction under the mandatory laws of the consumer's place of
            residence.
          </p>
          <p>
            We encourage you to contact us first so that we can try to resolve a question or dispute
            informally. Nothing in this paragraph prevents you from using a statutory consumer complaint,
